\begin_layout Standard
One advantage of the MSE is that it can be calculated for each geographical
 entity.
 As such, each box plot in panel (a) of Figure 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:mse"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"

\end_inset

