\end_inset

 present the MSE and bias results for all models.
 With the possible exception of the lasso, we find that all models perform
 comparably in terms of MSE and bias, meaning that the poor performance
 of XGBoost when using GIS covariates cannot be remedied by simply adopting
 a different machine-learning model.
